---

This project is a reimplementation, not a derivative in code. It shares no
source with reader3 by Andrej Karpathy (https://github.com/karpathy/reader3) or
with its own earlier implementation, ai-reader (https://github.com/taylorren/ai-reader)
— both also MIT licensed. What it inherits from them is the idea, and the credit
for it: one chapter at a time, beside an AI, from reader3; the feature set and
the schema, from ai-reader.

Its only EPUB dependency is epubx (https://github.com/taylorren/epubx), also MIT
licensed, which is where all knowledge of the EPUB format lives. reader3's parser
(`reader3.py`) and ebooklib are not vendored, forked or imported.
